UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc11`=' Hmm. Perhaps this grunt is more than he would appear. Perhaps this grunt is in actuality a sergeant. Look now upon Krom\'gar Sergeant $N, soldiers. He has come to serve warning of a cowardly Alliance attack. An attack that we will CRUSH!' WHERE `word_id` = 179560; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26004
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc11`=' I am not easily impressed, but if what you are telling me is true, then I have never before heard of such a thing. You have my thanks, $N.' WHERE `word_id` = 173877; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=14303
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc11`=' I apologize. It has been a very rough couple of days for all of us. I am Aggra. All of us here are what remains of the crew of the Draka\'s Fury. Perhaps we can work together. We have a common enemy in the Alliance. Their SI:7 assassins are all over this island and they\'re not going to stop until we\'re all dead.' WHERE `word_id` = 173607; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=14234
