UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc11`='Find both Dalinda and Tyranis if you can and come back to me with your findings. Start your search at this fortress. I will contact my superiors in Darnassus immediately and let them know the situation.$B$B$N, there is something else I wish to impress upon you. My superiors have shown some concern over Tyranis\' and his motives for coming here. It is more important to them that Dalinda is found and brought back safely. Tyranis is to be... gauged before he is taken home.' WHERE `word_id` = 135608; -- locales_quest - details : entry=1438
