UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc11`='Satisfaction. It is what I draw from the hammer and the anvil. To see a proud Horde warrior protected under my steel reminds me of what it is to be alive. It is an addiction that I dare never give up, $N.$B$BI can not grant you this satisfaction, merely set you upon the path. As with all of life\'s endeavors, the path of the armorsmith is a journey.$B$BIf you wish to be one of the select few, you need only to ask and I shall train, but, a task you must first complete.' WHERE `word_id` = 140245; -- locales_quest - details : entry=5301
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc11`='Satisfyingly crunchy. Now... you... $R thing... there\'s an Abomination wandering the hillside to the south. Go kill it. Kill it good.' WHERE `word_id` = 158189; -- locales_quest - details : entry=12023
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc11`='Sauranok, Sauranok. His own visions worked against him. Twilight\'s Hammer probably corrupted him from afar. Bah! Weak! We\'ll speak his name no more. I told him you were investigating the airship docks, $N. To flush him out. Yes, I used you as bait. You served your Horde well, and deserve a reward for outing this viper from our midst.' WHERE `word_id` = 182472; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26830
